1
00:00:08,091 --> 00:00:11,219
Ted scores again!
Oh my gosh!

2
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:12,721
Ted just slipped
right through

3
00:00:12,721 --> 00:00:14,431
that tackle like
it was nothing!

4
00:00:14,848 --> 00:00:15,849
Ted Vincent

5
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,308
is looking
like a superhero!

6
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,227
He just cut through
our entire defense!

7
00:00:19,936 --> 00:00:20,812
God,

8
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:22,105
he's worth at least
a hundred million

9
00:00:22,105 --> 00:00:22,981
on the
open market.

10
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:25,525
What? A
hundred million?

11
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:26,192
At least.

12
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:29,738
You called him a
washed-up nobody?

13
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:30,905
You had a star
on the team

14
00:00:30,905 --> 00:00:31,740
and you cut him.

15
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:32,907
I don't know
how he's doing this.

16
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:33,950
He was a scrub that

17
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:34,993
we had
doing odd jobs.

18
00:00:34,993 --> 00:00:35,952
I... I... I don't... 

19
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:37,412
He's not supposed
to be good.

20
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:40,331
You idiot! You
let this talent walk!

21
00:00:40,331 --> 00:00:41,583
West must go!

22
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:44,252
Boo...

23
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:46,629
This mess
is on you, West!

24
00:00:46,921 --> 00:00:48,339
I should have never
listened to you.

25
00:00:49,382 --> 00:00:51,009
There's no way I
can lose this game.

26
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:52,761
If we lose, I'm out.

27
00:00:52,761 --> 00:00:54,554
I can't afford to
lose everything.

28
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:56,097
Garcia!

29
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:08,610
Let's see how
you like this, Ted.
